			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 100060101,
					"content": "Hey, Durin! So this is where you've been!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060102,
					"content": "#Oh, {NICKNAME}, Paimon. What are you doing here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060103,
					"content": "Hehe, the real question is, what are you doing cooped up in here reading a book? The weather's nice out there, y'know?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060104,
					"content": "Oh. Well, ever since I've had more chances to interact with the people of Mondstadt, I've been having trouble telling when people are joking.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060105,
					"content": "For example, I saw a beautiful flower the last time I was at the florist. So, I told the shopkeeper, and she said:",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060106,
					"content": "\"Hehe, if you like these weeds so much, you should add some Mint and Sweet Flowers, and make it a bouquet.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060107,
					"content": "So I did as she said. But when I showed her the finished bouquet, she gave me a frankly terrifying look...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060108,
						100060109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060108,
					"content": "You have a unique perspective, Durin.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100060110,
					"content": "Later, Albedo opined that this happened because I have trouble understanding the \"meaning behind words.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060111,
					"content": "So, after I learned the Mondstadt script, he told me I could come here and read.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060112,
					"content": "I was born from a storybook, so I felt that these books might be able to teach me more about the \"rules\" of this world.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060113,
					"content": "And, well, I guess I lost track of time... So, um, did you guys need something?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060114,
						100060117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060114,
					"content": "Friends do often drop by just to say hi, Durin.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100060115,
					"content": "Oh, I see. That's another rule learned, then.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060116,
					"content": "Yep! That said, we did have business we needed to discuss, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060118,
					"content": "Yeah, we have a message to pass along from Rhinedottir.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060119,
					"content": "Oh... It... It's from Aunt Rhinedottir?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060120,
						100060121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060120,
					"content": "Are you okay?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100060122,
					"content": "No, I... I'm just surprised. Rhinedottir is my mom's friend... And the mother of the dragon that once existed in my stead.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060123,
					"content": "I supplanted him — took the fate that should have been his.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060124,
					"content": "So, if she dislikes me... Well, I'm not sure what I'd do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060125,
						100060126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060125,
					"content": "I don't think she holds it against you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100060127,
					"content": "Yeah! We're here for you! But, seriously, Paimon doesn't think it's anything bad.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060128,
					"content": "That does make me feel better.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060129,
					"content": "Well, I guess I should open it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060126,
					"content": "Either way, you have us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100060121,
					"content": "Don't be nervous.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100060117,
					"content": "So we're here at the Hexenzirkel's behest...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060118
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100060109,
					"content": "Feels like she's the one with the issue here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060110
					]
				}
			]
		},
