						],
						"pointId": 4
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 100060901,
					"content": "In fact, from a biological standpoint, I am no cat at all, but rather, an alchemical being. You wouldn't consider yourself a Specter simply because you float in the air like one, surely...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sebas"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060902,
					"content": "A Specter? What are you trying to say, mister?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060903,
					"content": "Oh, I know! Sebas is implying that you're—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Durin"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060904,
					"content": "Maybe don't finish that thought, Durin.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060905
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 100060905,
					"content": "What thought? Hey!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060906,
					"content": "Oh, and considering how Master Rhinedottir's message ended, I suppose this technique is useless now. I'll just destroy it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sebas"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060907,
					"content": "Few and far between are the people that can make her reconsider. Quite the impressive feat, young man.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100060908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sebas"
				},
				{
					"id": 100060908,
					"content": "With that done, I'll be going now. I have another message to pass along. Perhaps we'll meet again sometime.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Sebas"
				}
			]
		}
